<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Gablefen Realty</a></li><li>Buy with us</li></ol><p class="kick">Buying in Gablefen</p><h1>How we work with buyers</h1><p class="lede">A small-town search is still a search: you look, you walk through, and when you are ready we write an offer at the office. There is no offer form, account sign-up or payment on this site.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><ol class="steps"><li><span></span><span><b>Look at the window, then call</b><p class="muted" style="margin:4px 0 0">The listings and the plat are public. When something looks right, call the office or the agent named on the sheet. We will tell you when it can be seen, including at an open house.</p></span></li><li><span></span><span><b>Walk through</b><p class="muted" style="margin:4px 0 0">Open houses run most Saturdays, and some listings have a Sunday or a Friday evening. Private showings are arranged by phone. After a first meeting, the office can open a client account so you can read your tours and shortlist notes here.</p></span></li><li><span></span><span><b>Write at the office</b><p class="muted" style="margin:4px 0 0">Offers go through us, in writing, by email or on paper. We will tell you what recent sales actually closed at, not just what is asking. We do not collect offers, names or payments through this website.</p></span></li></ol><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><p class="kick">Talk to someone</p><p style="margin:0">Priya Sandoval works mostly with buyers. (555) 014-1862 · priya@gablefen.example. Or call the main desk at (555) 014-1860.</p></div></div></section>
